@startuml
title State machine: Azure SQL free-tier database (appdb)

[*] --> Active

Active : dbo.DemoItems serves reads/writes
Active --> AutoPaused : 60 minutes without connections\n(serverless auto-pause)
Active --> Paused : free compute limit reached\n(freeLimitExhaustionBehavior: AutoPause)

AutoPaused : compute released; storage kept
AutoPaused --> Resuming : GET /api/items connects\n(the connection attempt triggers the resume)

Resuming : up to about a minute\nGET /api/items returns 503 + Retry-After: 10\n{error: "The database is waking up. Retrying...",\n retryable: true}\nthe page retries every 10 s for up to 2 minutes
Resuming --> Active : resume complete\n(the next retry returns 200)

Paused : GET /api/items fails\n(500 "Unable to load demo items.\nCheck the API logs for details.")
Paused --> Active : monthly free allowance resets

@enduml
